 356:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] coreIndex The index of the CPU core for which the reset status is to be retrieved. Ra
 357:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 358:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval IfxCpu_ResetStatus The reset status of the CPU core. Range: \ref IfxCpu_ResetStatus.
